  "adaptationNotes": [
    "Repoint the provider-local module imports to the owned relative log-viewer modules and the Astrale public entrypoints.",
    "Drop the upstream modules that are outside the accepted source set: mock data, the JSON payload tree, the sidebar inspector, the heatmap, the paste dialog, and the saved filter dialog, with the controls that only open them.",
    "Expose a typed host boundary of default logs, loading, stream error, and optional live entry, copy, and export actions instead of the upstream generated mock data.",
    "Report pending, success, and error outcomes of the injected copy, export, and live entry actions in one polite live region that never contains log text.",
    "Adopt the Apache-2.0 Rivet follow-tail toggle, tab separated copy text, and stream error banner as the supporting authority for those behaviors.",
    "Name the search clear control, the level toggles, the live tail control, the service and time selects, and every icon control, and expose the row expansion state.",
    "Allow the upstream toolbar row to wrap so no control is clipped at 390px.",
    "Apply repository formatting without changing visual behavior, classes, anatomy, defaults, or copy."
  ],
